<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <style>
        * {
            font-family: 'Calibri Light', sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            color: #000;
        }

        /* Body clears the fixed footer (margins for this template are 0mm). */
        .page {
            padding: 0 40px 24mm 40px;
            position: relative;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            min-height: 250mm;
        }

        .page-bottom {
            position: absolute;
            left: 46px;
            right: 46px;
            bottom: 22mm;
        }

        .page-break {
            page-break-before: always;
        }

        .footer {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 6mm;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            background: #fff;
        }

        .footer-line {
            width: 100%;
            height: 2px;
            background: #000;
        }

        .footer-content {
            padding: 8px 10px;
        }

        .wm {
            position: fixed;
            left: 50%;
            top: 50%;
            width: 150mm;
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
            z-index: -1;
            opacity: 0.1;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .letter-body {
            font-size: 11px;
            line-height: 1.35;
            padding: 0 6px;
        }

        .letter-body p {
            margin: 4px 0;
        }

        .index-table {
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .index-table td {
            border: 1px solid #333;
            padding: 3px 16px;
            text-align: center;
            font-family: 'Century Gothic', sans-serif;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .index-logo {
            height: 46px;
            margin: 6px 0 10px 0;
        }

        .annexure-line {
            margin-left: 36px;
            text-indent: 36px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .fd-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin: 8px 0;
            font-size: 9.5px;
        }

        .fd-table th,
        .fd-table td {
            border: 1px solid #333;
            padding: 3px 5px;
            vertical-align: middle;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .fd-table th {
            font-weight: bold;
            line-height: 1.25;
        }

        .fd-table td {
            height: 16px;
        }

        .fd-amount {
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .page-label {
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 10px;
            margin-top: 6px;
        }

        .doc-footer-label {
            text-align: right;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 10px;
            margin-top: 4px;
        }

        .disclaimer {
            font-size: 6.5px;
            line-height: 1.25;
            text-align: justify;
            margin-top: 4px;
        }

        .signature-gap {
            height: 16px;
        }

        .signature-block p {
            margin: 0;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <img class="wm" alt="" src="data:image/png;base64,{{ img_watermark_base64 }}">
    <!-- Full-bleed letterhead bar -->
    <div style="border-top: 10px solid #333; border-bottom: 5px solid #f04e23;"></div>

    <!-- ============================ PAGE 1 ============================ -->
    <div class="page">
        <!-- Letterhead -->
        <div style="padding: 10px 0; font-family: sans-serif;">
            <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%;">
                <tr>
                    <td style="width: 50%; padding-left: 20px;">
                        <img src="data:image/png;base64,{{ img_logo_base64 }}"
                            alt="Volks Energie Logo" style="height: 60px;">
                    </td>
                    <td style="width: 50%; text-align: right; font-size: 10px; color: #333; padding-right: 20px;">
                        <div>
                            B-1/D8, 2nd floor,<br>
                            Mohan Cooperative Industrial Estate,<br>
                            New Delhi 110044
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <img src="data:image/png;base64,{{ img_phone_base64 }}"
                                alt="Phone" style="height: 12px; vertical-align: middle;">
                            +91 9650393636, +91 9654551781<br>
                            <img src="data:image/png;base64,{{ img_phone_base64 }}"
                                alt="Phone" style="height: 12px; vertical-align: middle;">
                            Accounts: +91 8882591733
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <img src="data:image/png;base64,{{ img_email_base64 }}"
                                alt="Email" style="height: 12px; vertical-align: middle;">
                            contact@volksenergie.in
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <img src="data:image/png;base64,{{ img_web_base64 }}"
                                alt="Website" style="height: 12px; vertical-align: middle;">
                            www.volksenergie.in
                        </div>
                    </td>
                </tr>
            </table>
            <hr />
        </div>

        <div class="letter-body">
            <table class="index-table">
                <tr>
                    <td>INDEX</td>
                </tr>
            </table>
            <img class="index-logo" src="data:image/png;base64,{{ img_logo_base64 }}" alt="Volks Energie Logo">

            <p class="annexure-line">Annexure I: Letter to be addressed by the client to the bank.</p>

            <p>
                To,<br>
                The Manager,<br>
                Au Small Finance Bank
            </p>
            <p style="margin-top: 8px;">Dear Sir,</p>

            <p style="text-align: justify;">
                I/We instruct you to mark a lien in favor of <strong>{{ beneficiary }}</strong> on the following
                fixed deposit(s) for the purpose of {{ purposeText }}{{#if referenceNo}} with reference number (if any)
                <strong>{{ referenceNo }}</strong>{{/if}}.
            </p>

            <table class="fd-table">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th style="width: 21%;">FD Account Number<br>(Branch to mention the below once the FD is
                            booked in system)</th>
                        <th style="width: 19%;">Date of Issue<br>(Branch to mention the below once the FD is booked
                            in system)</th>
                        <th style="width: 19%;">Date of Maturity<br>(Branch to mention the below once the FD is
                            booked in system)</th>
                        <th style="width: 21%;">Amount of Deposit (&#8377;)</th>
                        <th style="width: 20%;">Rate of Interest (% p.a.)</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr>
                        <td></td>
                        <td></td>
                        <td></td>
                        <td class="fd-amount">{{ amount }}</td>
                        <td></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td></td>
                        <td></td>
                        <td></td>
                        <td></td>
                        <td></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td></td>
                        <td></td>
                        <td></td>
                        <td></td>
                        <td></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td></td>
                        <td></td>
                        <td></td>
                        <td></td>
                        <td></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td></td>
                        <td></td>
                        <td></td>
                        <td></td>
                        <td></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td></td>
                        <td></td>
                        <td></td>
                        <td></td>
                        <td></td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>

            <p style="text-align: justify;">I/We hereby in relation to above detailed Fixed Deposits irrevocably
                instruct you as follows:</p>

            <p style="text-align: justify;">
                i. The amount under the said Fixed Deposit to be paid to <strong>{{ beneficiary }}</strong> on demand,
                at any point of time without any reference to us or without conducting any enquiry as to genuineness or
                reason for such demand by <strong>{{ beneficiary }}</strong>.
            </p>
            <p style="text-align: justify;">
                ii. No clearance from any authority/person other than <strong>{{ beneficiary }}</strong> shall be
                required for encashment of the fixed deposit, whether premature or otherwise.
            </p>
            <p style="text-align: justify;">
                iii. On receipt of lien revocation instruction by the <strong>{{ beneficiary }}</strong> interest
                accrued thereon be released to <strong>Volks Energie Private Limited</strong> after deduction of the
                TDS (if any) (this point to be filled only if the interest payout mode of TD is cumulative).
            </p>

            <div class="page-bottom">
                <p class="page-label">Page 1</p>
                <p class="doc-footer-label">Third party term deposit process</p>
                <p class="disclaimer">
                    This document constitutes Property of AU Small Finance Bank, and no part of this document may be
                    reproduced or transmitted in any form or by any means, electronic or mechanical, including
                    photocopying or recording or in any manner whatsoever without explicit consent of AU SFB. Any
                    violation shall be treated as violation of terms of employment and appropriate action shall be taken
                    accordingly.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ============================ PAGE 2 ============================ -->
    <div class="page page-break">
        <div class="letter-body">
            <table class="index-table" style="margin-top: 10px;">
                <tr>
                    <td>INDEX</td>
                </tr>
            </table>
            <img class="index-logo" src="data:image/png;base64,{{ img_logo_base64 }}" alt="Volks Energie Logo">

            <p style="text-align: justify;">
                iv. The said fixed deposit be auto renewed for the original period of deposit booked with the Bank,
                till the lien is active.
            </p>
            <p style="text-align: justify;">
                v. The line is being placed on the fixed deposit for a period of {{ lienPeriodText }}
                (<strong>from {{ lienFrom }} to {{ lienTo }}</strong>).
            </p>
            <p style="text-align: justify;">
                I/We confirm that the line is being marked and these instructions are being given pursuant to genuine
                and lawful transaction entered into by and between me/us and <strong>{{ beneficiary }}</strong>.
            </p>
            <p style="text-align: justify;">
                I/We hereby agree and confirm that the above-mentioned Fixed Deposit shall be released to me only upon
                written confirmation of <strong>{{ beneficiary }}</strong>.
            </p>
            <p style="text-align: justify;">
                I/We hereby further agree and confirm that any statutory/ regulatory attachment shall have priority
                over lien created in favor of <strong>{{ beneficiary }}</strong> and that you shall be entitled to act
                in accordance with instructions of any statutory/ regulatory authority notwithstanding any
                instructions to the contrary contained herein or any other document executed between the Bank and us.
            </p>
            <p style="text-align: justify;">
                I/We hereby agree that I/we shall be liable for payment of Tax deducted at source and undertake to keep
                you indemnified and hold the bank harmless against any claim by any union, state or local government
                authority against the bank, and of its subsidiaries or affiliates, regarding taxes assessed against us.
            </p>
            <p style="text-align: justify;">
                I/We confirm that these instructions are irrevocable and cannot be revoked except with the written
                consent of <strong>{{ beneficiary }}</strong>.
            </p>
            <p style="text-align: justify;">
                I/We undertake to hold the bank and its director, officers and agents harmless against any loss or
                damage caused due to acting on these instructions.
            </p>
            <p style="text-align: justify;">
                I/We agree and acknowledge that acting upon the aforesaid instructions shall be at the sole and
                absolute discretion of the Bank and the terms and conditions of the fixed deposit as stated on the
                website of the Bank www.aubank.in shall apply appropriately.
            </p>

            <p style="margin-top: 10px;">Yours faithfully,</p>
            <p>For <strong>Volks Energie Private Limited</strong></p>
            <div class="signature-gap"></div>
            <div class="signature-gap"></div>
            <p>Authorized Signatory</p>

            <div class="page-bottom">
                <p class="page-label" style="margin-top: 14px;">Page 2</p>
                <p class="doc-footer-label">Third party term deposit process</p>
                <p class="disclaimer">
                    This document constitutes Property of AU Small Finance Bank, and no part of this document may be
                    reproduced or transmitted in any form or by any means, electronic or mechanical, including
                    photocopying or recording or in any manner whatsoever without explicit consent of AU SFB. Any
                    violation shall be treated as violation of terms of employment and appropriate action shall be taken
                    accordingly.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <div class="footer">
        <div class="footer-content">
            <table width="100%" style="font-size: 12px; color: #555;">
                <tr>
                    <td style="text-align: left;"><b>CIN: </b>U40100DL2011PTC228907</td>
                    <td style="text-align: center;"><b>PAN: </b>AADCV9386C</td>
                    <td style="text-align: right;"><b>MSME: </b>UDYAM-DL-0900000465</td>
                </tr>
            </table>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-line"></div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>
